# L §2.1: fractions "allowed only in rows and only when the value doesn't terminate as a decimal";
# L §8.3 LOAD-PRECISION: "<a/b> terminates; write it as a decimal".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"

input f: num

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  f = 1/4

ask q1: f
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PRECISION ...
